            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Use the past perfect continuous for the earlier process. Start with the question phrase or auxiliary; keep other circumstances after the verb group. Ask whether an earlier discussion lacked a parallel record-keeping activity.",
